<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Belden Inc starts.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Belden Inc starts.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co has started coverage of Belden Inc with a rating of outperform, a source at the brokerage said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the specialty wire and cable maker closed at 35-7/8 on Monday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
